<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξῠρ-έω</span></b> , Trag. and 
			Att.
		 (v. infr.) ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξῠράω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.180b
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Artem.
			1.22
		</span></i> (also in pres.
		
			Med.
		, <i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			1.84
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Palaeph.
			32
		</span></i>, and pres.
		
			Pass.
		, <i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>Cyn.</u>
			14
		</span></i>) ; both forms in codd. of <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
		</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύρω</span> : fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>De.</u>
					21.12
				</span></i>
			 : aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξύρησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aff.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.35
			</span></i>, etc. :—
				Med.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ez.</u>
					44.20
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.15.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πριαμωθήσομαι</span>
			 : aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυρησάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					6.19
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				12.5
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					13.33
				</span></i>
			 : pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξύρημαι</span> (v. infr.) : (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρόν</span>):—<i>shave,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυροῦντες</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶντες</span>
			) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παιδίων τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.65
				</span></i>
			 : c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρήσας μιν τὰς τρίχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.35
				</span></i>
			 : prov. of danger or pain, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρεῖ γὰρ
				ἐν χρῷ</span>
			<i>it shaves</i> close, 'touches the quick', <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				786
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρεῖν ἐπιχειρεῖν
			λέοντα,</span> of a dangerous undertaking, 'beard the lion',
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				341c
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, <i>shave oneself</i> or <i>have oneself shaved,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρεῦνται</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶνται</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.36
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυρημένος</span> ibid., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				191
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρούμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					264
				</span></i>
			 : also c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυρεῦνται</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶνται</span>
			) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν τὸ σῶμα</span> they <i>shave
				their</i> whole body or <i>have</i> it <i>shaved,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.37
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὀφρύας, τὴν
			κεφαλήν,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυρημένος τὴν κεφαλήν</span>
			<i>with</i> one's head <i>shaved,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
